Third-party components
----------------------

The full dependency set is pinned in pyproject.toml and uv.lock. Their licences are recorded by the
packages themselves; a machine-readable inventory can be produced with:

    python3 scripts/audit-licences.py

This project is MIT and must remain free of copyleft in combination: GPL/AGPL/SSPL components may be
executed as separate processes, never linked or loaded into this codebase.
